Pre-registered extraction rules:
- E1: prefer explicit hash fields in order: reviewed_sha256, artifact_sha256, target_sha256, reviewed_artifact_sha256, hash fields inside `checks`... If multiple distinct full hashes appear for the same record, mark `ambiguous` unless one matches the live pin and others are explicitly historical.
