- E3: binding: bound if hash prefix == live class pin; stale if hash != live pin and resolves to a known older revision; unresolved otherwise (counts as not bound, listed).
- E4: supersession: same reviewer + same class + later created_at replaces earlier; a later revise/reject retracts an earlier accept; a later accept supersedes an earlier revise (but note both directions).
- E5: independence: distinct reviewers; count accept only if counts_toward_gate_accept != false and counts_as_full_schema_verdict != false (report both variants); flag reviewers who are authors of the artifact if determinable (e.g., authors listed in the artifact or known lead-formulation/audit authorship) — otherwise report as "author overlap unresolved" rather than guess.
- E6: duplicate reviewers count once (max one verdict per reviewer per class = latest at pin).

