This is the crux: I must distinguish **epistemic disclaimers** (no math/citation verdict, advisory, not a gate verdict) from **coverage limitations** (covers only axis X, not full schema). Every worker verdict in this project includes disclaimers. The gate criterion concerns coverage of the *schema review*, not whether the reviewer adjudicated mathematics. So my marker set must target coverage restriction:
  - "covers ONLY ... (axis|record|repair|delta|CH|SET|strictness|visibility|binding|metadata)"
  - "not the full schema"
